meta {
  name: Start new khatm cycle
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/khatm/groups/:groupId/cycles
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  groupId: uuid
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Replaces: start_new_cycle RPC (security-audit fix SA-007).

  Authorization: admin of the SOURCE group only, and the source group must
  have status COMPLETED. The new group's admin is the CALLER — the RPC
  deliberately never copies admin_user_id from the source row; preserve that.

  Response 201: the new group object (khatm_cycle = source + 1, fresh invite
  code, participants copied per current RPC semantics).

  409 if source group is not COMPLETED.
}
